<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#07101d">
  <title>{% block title %}我的交易系统{% endblock %}</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/app.css">
  {% block head_extra %}{% endblock %}
  <script src="/static/app.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <a class="brand" href="/">我的交易系统 <small>正式版</small></a>
  <nav>
    <a href="/">今日操作</a>
    <a href="/positions">我的持仓</a>
    <a href="/screener">历史记录</a>
    <a href="/data">数据状态</a>
    <a href="/logout">退出</a>
  </nav>
</header>
<main>{% block content %}{% endblock %}</main>
<footer>规则已冻结：最多6只；核心优先；收盘确认，下一交易日开盘执行；没有合格买点就空仓。</footer>

<div id="page-progress" class="page-progress" hidden>
  <div class="page-progress-card">
    <b id="page-progress-title">正在处理</b>
    <div class="job-track"><i id="page-progress-bar" style="width:8%"></i></div>
    <span id="page-progress-time" class="muted">已等待 0 秒</span>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
